Description: iPhone calls, messages and notifications on the GNOME desktop
 A quiet dot in the top bar when the iPhone is linked over Bluetooth: read
 and answer messages, answer or decline calls, see the notifications of the
 other apps. Nothing is installed on the iPhone.
 .
 This package holds the GNOME Shell extension and its engine.
